      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Mad girl! Even now, if I choose, I can become the chief queen!......",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`பட்டமகிஷி` is rendered as `chief queen`, preserving the courtly rank rather than reducing it to merely `queen`."
