        "speaker_label": "தோழி",
        "page_provenance": [
          {"pdf_page": 9, "printed_page": 8}
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "That is my wish too, amma. But while the Maharani and the prince are still alive...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The intimate address `அம்மா` is retained as `amma` because it marks the attendant's deferential conversational register."
        ]
      }
